@ref s 21(6G) (src:4037-4048)
GIVEN section IS A STRING
      reference IS A `s 21(6G) reference`
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
`s 21(6G) the reference includes` MEANS
    IF elem section `s 21(6G) the sections in which the references are read as stated`
    THEN (CONSIDER reference
          WHEN `s 21(6G)(a) a reference to treasury shares` THEN JUST "a reference to shares held by a subsidiary under subsection (4B) or (6C)"
          WHEN `s 21(6G)(b) a reference to a company being registered as a member of itself or being a member of itself` THEN JUST "a reference to a subsidiary being registered as a member of its holding company"
          OTHERWISE NOTHING)   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): paragraphs (a) and (b) name two kinds of reference; the text says nothing of any other
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the reading is "In sections 7(9)(ca), 33(5A), ..."; the text says nothing of any other section

§ `Section 21(7) to (9): sale of shares for a subsidiary, a guarantee company, and notices to the Registrar`

-- src:4052 | (7) Where but for this section a subsidiary would have been entitled
-- src:4053 | to subscribe for shares in the holding company, the holding company
-- src:4054 | may, on behalf of the subsidiary, sell the shares for which the
-- src:4055 | subsidiary would otherwise have been entitled to subscribe.
@ref s 21(7) (src:4052-4055)
GIVEN `but for this section the subsidiary would have been entitled to subscribe for shares in the holding company` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 21(7) the holding company may on behalf of the subsidiary sell the shares for which the subsidiary would otherwise have been entitled to subscribe` MEANS
    IF `but for this section the subsidiary would have been entitled to subscribe for shares in the holding company`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Where but for this section a subsidiary would have been entitled to subscribe for shares in the holding company, the holding company may, on behalf of the subsidiary, sell the shares" (a failed "where" on a "may": the periods ruling of 2026-11-05, item (b); split site (ii), fork line F-H-S1)

-- src:4057 | (8) In relation to a holding company that is a company limited by
-- src:4058 | guarantee, the reference in this section to shares is to be read as
-- src:4059 | including a reference to the interest of its members as such, whatever
-- src:4060 | the form of that interest.
@ref s 21(8) (src:4057-4060)
GIVEN `the liability of the members of the holding company` IS A `Liability of members`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 21(8) the reference to shares in this section includes a reference to the interest of the members as such, whatever the form of that interest` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the liability of the members of the holding company`
    WHEN `limited by guarantee` THEN JUST TRUE
    OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "In relation to a holding company that is a company limited by guarantee"; the text says nothing of any other holding company (a company limited both by shares and by guarantee is not named)

DECLARE `s 21(9) event` IS ONE OF
    `s 21(9)(a) a shareholder of a company that is a corporation becomes a subsidiary of the company`
    `s 21(9)(b) shares of the company are held by a subsidiary of the company and there is a change in the number of shares held by the subsidiary`
    `s 21(9) another event`

-- src:4062 | (9) For the purposes of this section, a company must inform the
-- src:4063 | Registrar of the occurrence of any of the following events by lodging
-- src:4064 | a notice in the prescribed form within 14 days after the date of
-- src:4065 | occurrence:
-- src:4067 | (a) where a shareholder of a company that is a corporation
-- src:4068 | becomes a subsidiary of the company;
-- src:4070 | (b) where shares of the company are held by a subsidiary of the
-- src:4071 | company and there is a change in the number of shares held
-- src:4072 | by the subsidiary.
@ref s 21(9) (src:4062-4072)
GIVEN event IS A `s 21(9) event`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 21(9) the company must inform the Registrar of the occurrence of the event by lodging a notice in the prescribed form` MEANS
    CONSIDER event
    WHEN `s 21(9)(a) a shareholder of a company that is a corporation becomes a subsidiary of the company` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 21(9)(b) shares of the company are held by a subsidiary of the company and there is a change in the number of shares held by the subsidiary` THEN JUST TRUE
    OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): "any of the following events"; the text does not say "only", and says nothing of any other event

-- src:4062 | (9) For the purposes of this section, a company must inform the
-- src:4063 | Registrar of the occurrence of any of the following events by lodging
-- src:4064 | a notice in the prescribed form within 14 days after the date of
-- src:4065 | occurrence:
-- src:4067 | (a) where a shareholder of a company that is a corporation
-- src:4068 | becomes a subsidiary of the company;
-- src:4070 | (b) where shares of the company are held by a subsidiary of the
-- src:4071 | company and there is a change in the number of shares held
-- src:4072 | by the subsidiary.
@ref s 21(9) (src:4062-4072)
GIVEN event IS A `s 21(9) event`
      `the date of occurrence` IS A DATE
      `the date the notice in the prescribed form was lodged with the Registrar` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 21(9) the company lodged the notice with the Registrar in time` MEANS
    CONSIDER event
    WHEN `s 21(9) another event` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): "any of the following events"; the text says nothing of any other event
    OTHERWISE (IF `the date the notice in the prescribed form was lodged with the Registrar` AT LEAST `the date of occurrence` AND `period: the date is not later than the end of a period after` `the date of occurrence` `the date the notice in the prescribed form was lodged with the Registrar` 14 Days
               THEN JUST TRUE
               ELSE JUST FALSE)   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "by lodging a notice in the prescribed form within 14 days after the date of occurrence" (a period the text fixes in its own words: the periods ruling of 2026-11-05, item (a); the day of occurrence is in time, fork line F-H-P2)

§ `Regulative rules of s 21`

DECLARE `s 21 act` IS ONE OF
    `s 21(4)(b) dispose of all of its shares in the holding company`
    `s 21(4C)(b) lodge with the Registrar a notice in the prescribed form of the change in the number of shares`
    `s 21(6A)(b) dispose of all of the shares in the holding company`
    `s 21(6D)(b) lodge with the Registrar a notice in the prescribed form of the change in the number of shares`
    `s 21(6E)(c) dispose of or cancel the excess shares, or procure the disposal of the excess shares by its subsidiary`
    `s 21(9) lodge with the Registrar a notice in the prescribed form of the event`

-- A DEADLINE: "within the period of 12 months or such longer period as the Court may allow after becoming the subsidiary".
-- The day the subsidiary became one is time 0; the parameter is the number of days after it on which the period ends (365, or 366 over a 29 February; longer if the Court allows).
-- src:3851 | (b) subject to subsections (4A) and (4B), the subsidiary must,
-- src:3852 | within the period of 12 months or such longer period as the
-- src:3853 | Court may allow after becoming the subsidiary of its
-- src:3854 | holding company, dispose of all of its shares in the holding
-- src:3855 | company.
@ref s 21(4)(b) (src:3851-3855)
GIVEN bearer IS A Party
      `the number of days after the subsidiary became a subsidiary of its holding company on which the period ends` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 21 act`
`s 21(4)(b) rule: the subsidiary's duty to dispose of all of its shares in the holding company` MEANS
    PARTY bearer
    MUST `s 21(4)(b) dispose of all of its shares in the holding company`
    WITHIN `the number of days after the subsidiary became a subsidiary of its holding company on which the period ends`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY bearer BECAUSE "the subsidiary did not dispose of all of its shares in the holding company within the period of 12 months or such longer period as the Court allowed"

-- A DEADLINE: "within 14 days after any change in the number of shares" (the day of the change is time 0).
-- src:3896 | (b) the holding company must, within 14 days after any
-- src:3897 | change in the number of shares in the holding company
-- src:3898 | which are held by any of its subsidiaries under
-- src:3899 | subsection (4B), lodge with the Registrar a notice in the
-- src:3900 | prescribed form.
@ref s 21(4C) (src:3896-3900)
GIVEN bearer IS A Party
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 21 act`
`s 21(4C)(b) rule: the holding company's duty to lodge a notice of the change in the number of shares` MEANS
    PARTY bearer
    MUST `s 21(4C)(b) lodge with the Registrar a notice in the prescribed form of the change in the number of shares`
    WITHIN 14
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY bearer BECAUSE "the holding company did not lodge a notice in the prescribed form within 14 days after the change in the number of shares held by its subsidiaries under subsection (4B)"

-- src:3927 | (b) subject to subsections (6B) and (6C), the subsidiary must,
-- src:3928 | within the period of 12 months or such longer period as the
-- src:3929 | Court may allow after the transfer to the subsidiary of the
-- src:3930 | shares in the holding company, dispose of all of the shares
-- src:3931 | in the holding company.
@ref s 21(6A)(b) (src:3927-3931)
GIVEN bearer IS A Party
      `the number of days after the transfer to the subsidiary on which the period ends` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 21 act`
`s 21(6A)(b) rule: the subsidiary's duty to dispose of all of the shares in the holding company` MEANS
    PARTY bearer
    MUST `s 21(6A)(b) dispose of all of the shares in the holding company`
    WITHIN `the number of days after the transfer to the subsidiary on which the period ends`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY bearer BECAUSE "the subsidiary did not dispose of all of the shares in the holding company within the period of 12 months or such longer period as the Court allowed"

-- src:3971 | (b) the holding company must, within 14 days after any
-- src:3972 | change in the number of shares in the holding company
-- src:3973 | which are held by any of its subsidiaries under subsection
-- src:3974 | (6C), lodge with the Registrar a notice in the prescribed
-- src:3975 | form.
@ref s 21(6D) (src:3971-3975)
GIVEN bearer IS A Party
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 21 act`
`s 21(6D)(b) rule: the holding company's duty to lodge a notice of the change in the number of shares` MEANS
    PARTY bearer
    MUST `s 21(6D)(b) lodge with the Registrar a notice in the prescribed form of the change in the number of shares`
    WITHIN 14
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY bearer BECAUSE "the holding company did not lodge a notice in the prescribed form within 14 days after the change in the number of shares held by its subsidiaries under subsection (6C)"

-- A DEADLINE: "before the end of the period of 6 months beginning with the day on which that contravention occurs, or such further period as the Registrar may allow".
-- The day of the contravention is time 0; the parameter is the number of days after it on which the period ends (for 1 January to 30 June, 180).
-- src:4000 | (c) where paragraph (a) or (b) is contravened, the holding
-- src:4001 | company must dispose of or cancel the excess shares, or
-- src:4002 | procure the disposal of the excess shares by its subsidiary,
-- src:4003 | in accordance with section 76K before the end of the
-- src:4004 | period of 6 months beginning with the day on which that
-- src:4005 | contravention occurs, or such further period as the
-- src:4006 | Registrar may allow;
@ref s 21(6E)(c) (src:4000-4006)
GIVEN bearer IS A Party
      `the number of days after the day of the contravention on which the period ends` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 21 act`
`s 21(6E)(c) rule: the holding company's duty to dispose of or cancel the excess shares` MEANS
    PARTY bearer
    MUST `s 21(6E)(c) dispose of or cancel the excess shares, or procure the disposal of the excess shares by its subsidiary`
    WITHIN `the number of days after the day of the contravention on which the period ends`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY bearer BECAUSE "the holding company did not dispose of or cancel the excess shares before the end of the period of 6 months beginning with the day on which the contravention occurred, or such further period as the Registrar allowed"

-- src:4062 | (9) For the purposes of this section, a company must inform the
-- src:4063 | Registrar of the occurrence of any of the following events by lodging
-- src:4064 | a notice in the prescribed form within 14 days after the date of
-- src:4065 | occurrence:
-- src:4067 | (a) where a shareholder of a company that is a corporation
-- src:4068 | becomes a subsidiary of the company;
-- src:4070 | (b) where shares of the company are held by a subsidiary of the
-- src:4071 | company and there is a change in the number of shares held
-- src:4072 | by the subsidiary.
@ref s 21(9) (src:4062-4072)
GIVEN bearer IS A Party
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 21 act`
`s 21(9) rule: the company's duty to inform the Registrar of the event` MEANS
    PARTY bearer
    MUST `s 21(9) lodge with the Registrar a notice in the prescribed form of the event`
    WITHIN 14
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY bearer BECAUSE "the company did not lodge a notice in the prescribed form within 14 days after the date of occurrence of the event"
